      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The three companies contacted me within a week.  I found BJ While Electrics the small company out of the three and my first instinct was to go with one of the other two.  Then after a week, I had and very detailed quote and pages and pages of information from one company (that also offered a tablet if I accepted their quote within 7 days) and a very simple one page quotation from BJ Electrics.  The third company said their sales manager would call me and that is the last I heard from them.  Scott at BJ Electrics was the only person out of the three of them to call me as a follow up more than once as each time I said I needed more time to go over all the other material.  In the end, I went with BJ Electrics and so far I am very pleased with that decision.  I must say also that the Solarquotes.com.au website has been a godsend!  I have spent the past 2 years looking into solar, getting quotes and advice and I just kept putting it into the too hard basket!  Solarquotes made it so much easier by giving me the information I needed without all the sales hype.  Thank you for providing this wonderful service.  Now if only we can get the government and greedy power companies to stop punishing people who install solar but increasing rates and the service to property charge! They are pathetic!  Bring on the batteries at an affordable price!",
